<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημοσύνη</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		 and 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνᾱμοσύνα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remembrance,
				memory</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τις ἔπειτα πυρὸς . .
				γενέσθω</span> let us be mindful of fire, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.181
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μ. σέθεν ἔσσετ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἀνεγείρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					8.74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. καὶ τόνος ἀμφ᾽ ἀρετῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					1.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				6.12
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>:—in 
				Att.
			 only as pr.n. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as pr. n. <u>Mnemosyne</u>, mother of the Muses,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				429
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				679
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				191d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				50.403
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thespiae</span>); M. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς εὐνέτις, ἣ τέκε Μούσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					789
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μναμόνα,
		Μνημώ</span>.</div>
